{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GREED</strong> is a PSX styled FPS designed for replayability through speedrunning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the best shooters of the '90s and today, such as <i>DOOM</i>, <i>ULTRAKILL</i>, and the original <i>Half-Life.</i>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch your enemies fall to the ground and crush their skulls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Defeat enemies big and small with your onslaught of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replay levels to master them and achieve better times (for bragging rights).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore multiple environments all with their own enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rid the world of greed and take back heaven.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627640?t=1746765661","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627640/cf1a1594c06f93356153938f8016ce3181ca5d25/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746765661","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627640/c8a6ca909e9e584677232550e84aba08a0c3c2eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746765661","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627640/c8a6ca909e9e584677232550e84aba08a0c3c2eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746765661","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of explicit violence and gore, and a little bit of swearing."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GREED</strong> is a PSX styled FPS designed for replayability through speedrunning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the best shooters of the '90s and today, such as <i>DOOM</i>, <i>ULTRAKILL</i>, and the original <i>Half-Life.</i>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_